OL,3,GNEWSAMore SEND pupils may be taught in
OL,4,Amainstream schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore pupils with Special Educational
OL,7,FNeeds and Disabilities (SEND) in
OL,8,FWolverhampton could be taught in
OL,9,Fmainstream settings, under plans being
OL,10,Fconsidered by the city council.
OL,12,FIdentifying their needs earlier and
OL,13,Foffering better access to specialist
OL,14,Fsupport are among reforms being looked
OL,15,Fat in a draft SEND and Inclusion
OL,16,FStrategy for 2027- 2029.
OL,18,FA six-week public consultation over the
OL,19,Fplans, drawn up in partnership with
OL,20,Feducation providers, health services,
OL,21,Fparents and carers, has started.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
