OL,3,GNEWSAMore SEND pupils may be taught in
OL,4,Amainstream schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FRosemary Ward, whose three children
OL,7,Fhave support at a unit within a primary
OL,8,Fschool, said she backed a move to
OL,9,Fmainstream schooling, but hoped
OL,10,Fteachers would get better training to
OL,11,Fsupport pupils.
